{"id":454,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Its crimson claws contain a virulent toxin. This toxin can be made into a tonic by diluting it, mixing it with several types of wild grass, and boiling it down over two days."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It booms out a victory croak when its prey goes down in defeat. This Pokémon and Seismitoad are related species."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It bounces toward opponents and gouges them with poisonous claws. No more than a scratch is needed to knock out its adversaries."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Diamond"],"text":"Its knuckle claws secrete a toxin so vile that even a scratch could prove fatal."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It has a poison sac at its throat. When it croaks, the stored poison is churned for greater potency."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"The croaking that Toxicroak produces before a battle is for churning the poison it has stored in its poison sac."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"Swaying and dodging the attacks of its foes, it weaves its flexible body in close, then lunges out with its poisonous claws."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"The toxin made in its poison sacs is pumped to the knuckle claws through tubes down its arms."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Anticipation","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon can sense an opposing Pokémon's dangerous moves."},{"name":"Dry Skin","hidden":false,"description":"Restores the Pokémon's HP in rain or when it is hit by Water-type moves. Reduces HP in harsh sunlight, and increases the damage received from Fire-type moves."},{"name":"Poison Touch","hidden":true,"description":"May poison a target when the Pokémon makes contact."}],"eggGroups":["Human-Like"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Blue","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":453,"name":"Croagunk","condition":null,"children":[{"id":454,"name":"Toxicroak","condition":"Lv. 37","c